<title>HONG KONG: HK Nov property deals up 22 pct in value on month.</title>
<headline>HK Nov property deals up 22 pct in value on month.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong recorded 16,015 sale and purchase agreements worth HK$59 billion for residential and non-residential building units in November, the government Land Registry said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The value of the agreements rose 21.9 percent from October 1996 and 186.2 percent from November last year, it said.</p>
<p>The number of deals rose 15.3 percent from October this year and 100 percent from November 1995, it said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
